UNSIGNED BUILDS

The .ipa files published here carry no Apple code signature. They are
offered for sideloading with tools that do not require one, and the
decision to install one is the installer's own.

THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

SwiftDrome includes work belonging to other people, covered by its own
terms rather than by this notice. The app lists it under
